\pard\ql\sl276\slmult1\b\cf1\fs28 1.0 Executive Summary\par
\pard\qj\sl276\slmult1\cf5\fs24 During the week ending August 22, 2026, the ZimMarket engineering team executed a major functional sprint focused on high-impact customer communication, commercial analytics, and taxonomy flexibility. The primary engineering accomplishments include the deployment of a real-time WebSocket-powered Buyer-to-Vendor Live Chat system, an in-house SVG interactive sales trajectory and category analytics engine, a dynamic category management framework in the administrative dashboard, and strict store isolation architecture to protect vendor catalogs.\par
\par
\pard\qj\sl276\slmult1 All software components were developed with performance and mobile data efficiency as core requirements. Zero third-party charting libraries were introduced, preserving sub-second build times (673ms) and a compact bundle size. The platform remains stable in production edge deployment on Vercel with seamless database synchronization on Supabase.\par
\par
\pard\ql\sl276\slmult1\b\cf1\fs28 2.0 Project Overview & Architecture\par
\pard\qj\sl276\slmult1\cf5\fs24 ZimMarket is an enterprise-grade, peer-to-peer (P2P) multi-vendor e-commerce platform specifically designed for the Zimbabwean economic landscape. The platform natively addresses local market challenges, including dual-currency support (USD and Zimbabwe Gold - ZiG), WhatsApp-based merchant negotiation, multi-company catalog aggregation, and lightweight mobile data consumption for buyers on cellular networks.\par
\par
\pard\qj\sl276\slmult1 The system architecture utilizes a modern serverless design:\par
\pard{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf0\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\qj\sl276\slmult1\b\cf5 Frontend Layer: \b0 React 19 powered by Vite with custom Vanilla CSS glassmorphic design tokens, responsive mobile bottom navigation, and progressive web application (PWA) readiness.\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\b\cf5 Backend Layer: \b0 Supabase Serverless PostgreSQL equipped with Row Level Security (RLS) policies, Realtime WebSocket replication, Edge Functions, and Blob Storage CDN.\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\b\cf5 Deployment & Edge: \b0 Continuous integration and automated deployment (CI/CD) via Vercel Edge Network with sub-second global asset delivery.\par
\par
\pard\ql\sl276\slmult1\b\cf1\fs28 3.0 Sprint Deliverables & Work Accomplished\par
\pard\ql\sl276\slmult1\b\cf2\fs26 3.1 Buyer-to-Vendor Real-Time Live Chat System (ChatContext.jsx & LiveChatDrawer.jsx)\par
\pard\qj\sl276\slmult1\cf5\fs24 To bridge communication between buyers and vendors and remove pre-purchase uncertainty, a full-stack real-time messaging system was engineered:\par
\pard{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf0\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\qj\sl276\slmult1\b\cf5 Direct Storefront Chat Triggers: \b0 Integrated prominent Live Chat buttons across all product cards and inside the Quick View modal in BuyerStorefront.jsx, enabling one-click customer-to-merchant inquiry.\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\b\cf5 Pinned Product Context Card: \b0 When a chat is initiated from a product listing, the conversation automatically binds and displays the product's thumbnail image, title, and formatted price at the top of the chat thread.\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\b\cf5 Glassmorphic Slide-Out Drawer: \b0 Engineered a floating bottom-right drawer featuring conversation search, unread badge counters, delivery receipts (single check for sent, double check for read), and auto-scrolling message streams.\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\b\cf5 Database Replication & RLS Security: \b0 Authored SQL migration 20231010000023_add_live_chat_system.sql establishing the conversations and chat_messages tables, secured with strict RLS policies allowing access only to conversation participants and platform superadmins, with Supabase Realtime publication active.\par
\par
\pard\ql\sl276\slmult1\b\cf2\fs26 3.2 Interactive Sales Analytics & Revenue Trajectory Engine (SalesTrendChart.jsx & CategoryBreakdownChart.jsx)\par
\pard\qj\sl276\slmult1\cf5\fs24 To provide vendors and administrators with visual commercial intelligence without loading heavy third-party bundle bloat, a custom SVG-based analytics engine was developed:\par
\pard{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf0\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\qj\sl276\slmult1\b\cf5 Vector B\'e9zier Curve Area Chart: \b0 Built an interactive area chart utilizing smooth cubic B\'e9zier mathematical interpolation, emerald-to-cyan gradient fills, and glowing stroke lines.\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\b\cf5 Dynamic Time-Range Selectors: \b0 Equipped charts with interactive filter tabs for 7 Days, 30 Days, 90 Days, and 6 Months.\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\b\cf5 Interactive Hover Crosshair & Tooltip: \b0 Implemented mouse-tracking crosshairs and floating glassmorphic tooltips displaying precise daily GMV in active currency (USD $ or ZiG ZWG) and order count.\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\b\cf5 Category Distribution Visualizer: \b0 Engineered CategoryBreakdownChart.jsx displaying stacked percentage progress strips and item volume distribution across all commercial sectors.\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\b\cf5 Embedded Multi-Tier Visibility: \b0 Embedded platform-wide GMV trajectory into AdminDashboard.jsx and store-level revenue trajectory into VendorInventory.jsx.\par
\par
\pard\ql\sl276\slmult1\b\cf2\fs26 3.3 Dynamic Category & Subcategory Management Engine (AdminDashboard.jsx)\par
\pard\qj\sl276\slmult1\cf5\fs24 To allow the platform creator to dynamically scale into new industries without redeploying frontend code, a centralized taxonomy management system was established:\par
\pard{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf0\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\qj\sl276\slmult1\b\cf5 Superadmin Category Manager: \b0 Built an administrative management interface allowing superadmins to create new categories, assign custom emoji icons (e.g. 📱, ⚡, 🌾, 🚗, 🏡), and manage comma-separated lists of subcategories.\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\b\cf5 Database Schema & Seeding: \b0 Created migration 20231010000024_add_categories_table.sql with public read RLS and superadmin-only write access, seeded with standard Zimbabwean market sectors: Electronics, Fashion, Auto Parts, Solar & Energy, Agriculture, Home & Hardware, Vehicles, Beauty & Health, and Other.\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\b\cf5 Storefront & Upload Sync: \b0 Updated BuyerStorefront.jsx to dynamically load category filter pills with icons and nested subcategories, and synchronized ProductUploadForm.jsx to populate vendor upload dropdowns dynamically.\par
\par
\pard\ql\sl276\slmult1\b\cf2\fs26 3.4 Multi-Store Isolation, Store Directory & Suspension Controls\par
\pard\qj\sl276\slmult1\cf5\fs24 To maintain clean multi-tenant commercial boundaries between independent merchants and the platform creator:\par
\pard{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf0\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\qj\sl276\slmult1\b\cf5 Strict Role Partitioning: \b0 Enforced role separation between System Admin (app creator with cross-store oversight) and Vendors (store admins restricted to their private catalog).\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\b\cf5 Superadmin Multi-Store Switcher: \b0 Added store selector banners in VendorInventory.jsx and VendorOrders.jsx allowing administrators to switch between All Stores and specific vendor inventories.\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\b\cf5 Store Suspension & Deletion Procedures: \b0 Created migration 20231010000022_add_vendor_is_active_and_delete_store_rpc.sql adding is_active status flags and admin_delete_vendor_store RPC. Suspended store products are automatically hidden from buyers.\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\b\cf5 Permanent Removal of Global Purges: \b0 Dropped all dangerous global catalog purge stored procedures (20231010000021_drop_global_purge_rpc.sql) and restricted catalog management strictly to targeted single-store purges.\par
\par
\pard\ql\sl276\slmult1\b\cf2\fs26 3.5 PostgREST API Hardening & Production Staging\par
\pard\qj\sl276\slmult1\cf5\fs24 To maintain flawless uptime and zero console exceptions across the user journey:\par
\pard{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf0\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\qj\sl276\slmult1\b\cf5 Elimination of HTTP 400 Bad Request: \b0 Refactored ChatContext.jsx to eliminate ambiguous PostgREST embedded joins, replacing them with direct queries and dynamic client-side profile enrichment.\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\b\cf5 Resolved ReferenceError (dbCategories): \b0 Corrected state initialization in BuyerStorefront.jsx.\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\b\cf5 Build Speed Optimization: \b0 Achieved verified sub-second Vite production compilation times (673ms \endash  825ms) across 81 modules.\par
{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}\b\cf5 Continuous Edge Deployment: \b0 Pushed all code commits (754cda1, 2d14214, ba85adc, f64ff04) to GitHub main, triggering automated edge deployments on Vercel.\par
\par
