\pard\ql\sl276\slmult1\b\cf1\fs28 6.0 Technical Challenges, Edge Cases & Applied Solutions\par
\pard{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf0\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\qj\sl276\slmult1\b\cf5 Challenge 1: PostgREST HTTP 400 on Foreign Key Embedding \endash  \b0 PostgREST rejected relation embedding via !conversations_buyer_id_fkey due to unnamed foreign key constraints on the database.\par
\pard\fi-360\li1080\qj\sl276\slmult1\b\cf1 Solution: \b0\cf5 Refactored ChatContext.jsx to fetch base records and attach merchant profile metadata dynamically in client-side JavaScript.\par
\pard{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf0\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\qj\sl276\slmult1\b\cf5 Challenge 2: Charting Library Bundle Bloat \endash  \b0 Standard third-party React charting libraries (e.g. Chart.js, Recharts) would inflate client bundles by 300kB+.\par
\pard\fi-360\li1080\qj\sl276\slmult1\b\cf1 Solution: \b0\cf5 Built custom SVG vector components (SalesTrendChart.jsx and CategoryBreakdownChart.jsx) utilizing cubic B\'e9zier mathematics, maintaining sub-second builds with 0 external dependencies.\par
\pard{\pntext\f0\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf0\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\qj\sl276\slmult1\b\cf5 Challenge 3: Accidental Catalog Wipe Risks \endash  \b0 Global catalog purge stored procedures posed a critical risk to live production data.\par
\pard\fi-360\li1080\qj\sl276\slmult1\b\cf1 Solution: \b0\cf5 Permanently dropped all global purge procedures via SQL migrations and replaced them with single-store targeted purges protected by exact confirmation inputs.\par
\par
